# Screenshots Directory

Add your application screenshots here:

- `desktop-home.png` - Desktop homepage view
- `desktop-clips.png` - Desktop saved clips view
- `mobile-search.png` - Mobile search interface
- `mobile-player.png` - Mobile video player

Recommended screenshot sizes:
- Desktop: 1920x1080 or 1440x900
- Mobile: 375x812 (iPhone X) or 360x640 (Android)
